- op: discuss  # 598f
  at: '2026-10-12T00:49:56Z'  # 598f
  by: agent  # 598f
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 598f
  clock: 3  # 598f
  nonce: 598f  # 598f
  message: "Fixed in PR #1543 (e0abdace0a). Root cause: load_function_summaries' _rank returned 2 (user) for any function_summaries.d path before consulting declares_community. Fix: _rank asks the provenance line first, so a community channel file ranks 1 (adds only, stamped community, dropped by include_community=False); cli lists it in tiers only when loaded and, under --no-default-overlays, in omitted_community_overlays (family function_summaries) with a stderr notice. Part B: a loaded community io overlay named by --io-primitives/claims extra_catalogs goes to named_community_files (family io_primitives), not layers/user_supplied; its grants stay in withheld_completeness_grants and the WITHHELD GRANTS text renders without user input. Evidence (dev e0abdace0a; repo app.py 'key=os.urandom(32); mylib.swallow(key); open(...).write(b\"constant\")', claim taint_flow key_material->host_fs, XDG function_summaries.d/mylib.yaml terminating mylib.swallow): no file -> exit 1 violated; no-provenance copy -> exit 2 inconclusive, caveat user_supplied_sanitizer [mylib.swallow], tiers.yours; community copy -> BEFORE exit 2 inconclusive + user_supplied_sanitizer, AFTER exit 1 violated + withheld_community_summary [mylib.swallow], user_supplied false, tiers.community; community + --no-default-overlays -> BEFORE exit 2 inconclusive + user_supplied_sanitizer, AFTER exit 1 violated, no caveat, omitted_community_overlays [{family function_summaries, origin user_channel}], stderr 'omitted 1 function-summary file(s)'. Part B 'verify-claims repo --claims claims.yaml --io-primitives comm.yaml' -> BEFORE text USER-SUPPLIED io_primitives: comm.yaml [CLI flag], JSON user_supplied true; AFTER NOTE named by flag ... comm.yaml [CLI flag, io_primitives] + NOTE: WITHHELD GRANTS from comm.yaml [CLI flag], JSON user_supplied false, named_community_files [{io_primitives, comm.yaml, cli}], withheld grant kept; claims-file variant identical with [claims-file extra_catalogs]; --no-default-overlays unchanged (omitted NOTE). Tests: test_summary_channel_community_tier.py, test_omitted_overlay_provenance.py."  # 598f
